1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,008
Santa's Village: snow, lights, and a workshop full of elves who really should have

2
00:00:04,008 --> 00:00:04,460
gone home.

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,429
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:09,431
Santa's Village has no special setup.

5
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:13,234
The Victims here are Santa's elves, busy and in the way.

6
00:00:13,234 --> 00:00:17,526
Each time you move into a space with normal yellow Victims, you lose one Time for

7
00:00:17,526 --> 00:00:18,480
each Victim there.

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,556
It only applies when you move in. It doesn't apply when Victims follow you, panic

9
00:00:22,556 --> 00:00:24,460
into your space, or are placed with you.

10
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:29,050
So crowded spaces are expensive. The Workshop Hammer item caps it at one Time,

11
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,675
however many elves there are.

12
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,623
It's Santa! places Santa in Santa's House.

13
00:00:33,623 --> 00:00:36,605
While he's with you, any number of Victims will follow you.

14
00:00:36,605 --> 00:00:39,031
If he dies, Bloodlust and Horror both go up two.

15
00:00:39,251 --> 00:00:43,288
The Head Elf lets you resolve a Search card once a turn as if it were in your hand.

16
00:00:43,288 --> 00:00:47,180
Blizzard puts tokens round the Village Centre that you can't move into, and they

17
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,104
circle each Upkeep.

18
00:00:48,324 --> 00:00:52,445
The Yeti can't be targeted or killed, panics every Upkeep, and does two damage in

19
00:00:52,445 --> 00:00:54,276
its space, hitting the Killer first.

20
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,571
Fire! rolls for Santa's House, Santa's Workshop or the Stables.

21
00:00:58,571 --> 00:01:01,436
Every Victim there dies and its Items are discarded.

22
00:01:01,656 --> 00:01:05,507
Where Did It Go? takes the Killer off the board, and at the start of the next Killer

23
00:01:05,507 --> 00:01:07,203
phase places him right in your space.

24
00:01:08,033 --> 00:01:12,236
A few tips. Plan routes around crowded spaces, because each elf costs you Time.

25
00:01:12,456 --> 00:01:15,815
Let Victims follow or panic to you rather than walking into them.

26
00:01:15,815 --> 00:01:18,915
And if Santa turns up, use him to lead everyone out at once.

27
00:01:18,915 --> 00:01:19,432
Good luck.

